=== list-sort-private-callable-attr
from: Pretty::Table 0.0.4 lib/Pretty/Table.rakumod:1316
license: MIT
feature: method sort
--- code
my class Table {
    has &!sort-key = *.[1];
    has @.rows;
    method sorted { my @rows = @!rows; @rows = @rows.sort(&!sort-key); @rows }
}
say Table.new(rows => ([1, 'b'], [2, 'a'])).sorted.map(*[0]);
--- expect
(2 1)

=== list-sort-then-reverse
from: Text::Plot 0.1.4 lib/Text/Plot.rakumod:507
license: Artistic-2.0
feature: method reverse
--- code
my @tally = 3, 11, 2;
@tally = @tally.sort.reverse;
say @tally;
say <b c a>.sort.reverse.join;
