=== list-sort-by-int-keys
from: LLM::Chat 0.10.0 lib/LLM/Chat/Backend/Response.rakumod:207
license: Artistic-2.0
feature: method sort
--- code
my %tool-call-builders = '10' => 'c', '2' => 'b', '0' => 'a';
say %tool-call-builders.keys.sort(*.Int).map({ %tool-call-builders{$_} }).join;
